# EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

**Scope: **

20 curriculum areas assessed via comprehensive HoA audit. Portfolio includes core academics (English, Maths), vocational (Construction, Motor Vehicle, Engineering), specialist (Computing, Creative & Digital), health/care, and support services. All areas have Digital Leads identified.

**Portfolio Distribution: **

3 Level 1 (Confident): Computing, HBH/EYE, Maths

12 Level 2 (On Track): BUS, CREATIVE_DIGITAL, EFE, EEY, English, FE Counselling, FEH, MOT, PAS, Project Mgmt, SIX, Sport

5 Level 3 (Developing): CON/BUI/MOT, Engineering, HAC, Pre Employment, Protective Services

0 Level 4–5 (Urgent): Healthy portfolio distribution

**Key Findings: **

Accessibility & Inclusion (Dimension 5) remains weakest across portfolio. 12 areas ready for fortnightly coaching. 5 areas require infrastructure support (network, software, hardware). 2 areas have DL clarification needed (Pre Employment: ?, Maths: selection pending).

**Status Check: **

20/20 HoAs submitted audit responses. Coverage: 59% of original 34 curriculum areas. Recommend follow-up with remaining 14 areas (ANM, ESO, AHE, etc.) if targeting 100% college coverage.

